{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["כי פי המדבר אליכם — And until now, according to the core of its plain sense, it was by means of an interpreter. In the tidings that you shall tell my father — not from hearsay that you heard from others, for you yourselves see and recognize that I, Yosef, am speaking to you, and therefore והגדתם את כל כבודי במצרים ואת כל אשר ראיתם."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 45, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:47:16.565216404Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}